  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The osmotic pressure of solutions of PVC&nbsp;in cyclohexanone at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> are plotted on the graph. The molar mass of PVC is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> (Nearest integer)</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/368b80fb-646b-4164-b1bc-e93a96e30134-9894493.PNG\" style=\"width: 218px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p>(Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>083</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> )</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "41500",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Using osmotic pressure in ideal gas equation:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mi>RT</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>RT</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>RT</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>RT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>RT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>If we assume given graph between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>C</mi></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a651bca9-9b9c-45ec-b9e5-53c7d1e17f37-9894493.PNG\" style=\"width: 218px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p>Slope <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>RT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>083</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>083</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>830</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>500</mn><mi>gm</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mole</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
